DEFINE DOMAIN synthesis-delivery
DESCRIPTION Which stored tool results the analysts read, and which are delivered in this prompt. The lines are computed from the stored tool calls and the analysts' tool calls, not reported by a model.

{{coverage}}
{{counts}}

DEFINE COMPONENT delivery-rules
ASSERT a [COVERED ...] line stands for a stored result that an analyst named in it read with a tool; its findings are in that analyst's contribution
WHEN a count, total, ranking or list appears in an analyst contribution THEN state it as the analyst stated it
NEVER derive a count, sum, average or ranking from the stored results delivered below by eye; a count or total comes from a tool result only
WHEN an [ARTIFACT UNAVAILABLE ...] line stands in place of a stored result THEN treat that result as UNKNOWN and say so with the call counts above
